---
layout: base.njk
extraHead: |
  <style>
      .contact-details,
      .contact-form {
          margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .contact-details p {
          margin: 10px 0;
      }

      .map {
          margin-top: 20px;
          text-align: center;
      }

      .map-link-btn {
          display: inline-block;
          background-color: #004080;
          color: white;
          padding: 10px 20px;
          border-radius: 4px;
          font-size: 16px;
          text-decoration: none;
          margin-top: 10px;
      }

      .map-link-btn:hover {
          background-color: #003060;
          color: white;
      }

      .contact-form form {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
      }

      .contact-form input,
      .contact-form textarea {
          padding: 10px;
          margin: 8px 0;
          border: 1px solid #ccc;
          border-radius: 4px;
          font-size: 16px;
      }

      .contact-form button {
          background-color: #004080;
          color: white;
          padding: 10px;
          border: none;
          border-radius: 4px;
          font-size: 16px;
          cursor: pointer;
      }

      .contact-form button:hover {
          background-color: #003060;
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
          .contact-us-container {
              padding: 10px;
          }
      }
  </style>
---
{#
  Bespoke layout for /contact-us/ (CMS restructure plan, Tier 3 phase 6).

  The institute name/address/email/phone data-cms-text/data-cms-source
  mechanism (wired up in an earlier commit this session, fe6374a) is left
  completely untouched here -- those facts are already CMS-editable via
  Site Settings, not this page's own front matter.

  The email address (a real <a href="mailto:..."> now, not plain text --
  see below) and the "Send Us a Message" form both had a real bug fixed
  alongside the address update: a <form action="mailto:...">, even one
  never actually submitted, makes Chrome log a "Mixed Content: ... form
  that targets an insecure endpoint" console warning the moment the page
  loads (mailto: isn't https, and Chrome flags any *form action* left in
  a non-http(s) scheme -- a plain <a href="mailto:..."> link, which this
  page also has, is never flagged the same way; only the declarative
  <form action="mailto:"> pattern is). The form no longer carries a
  static action attribute at all -- js/cms-content.js's renderMailto()
  now composes the mailto: URL from the entered name/email/message on
  submit and navigates to it via window.location.href instead, which
  Chrome's mixed-content form check doesn't flag (it can't statically
  analyze a JS-driven navigation). Both the visible email link and the
  form now read from Site Settings' comma-separated "email" field
  (currently admin@dietchennai.org, admin@dietchn.ac.in), so updating
  the address(es) in one place keeps both in sync, same reasoning as
  map_link_url below.

  What this pass structures is everything that was still hardcoded: the
  page's inline <style> block (moved here from the page's own
  extraHead front matter -- it's layout CSS, not editorial content, so it
  belongs in the layout, not repeated in every save of the page) and the
  Google Maps embed. This used to be an <iframe>, but Google Maps can't be
  framed under this site's Content-Security-Policy (default-src 'self',
  no frame-src for maps.google.com) -- confirmed live-broken the same way
  the coursedeled apply-modal iframes were. Replaced with a plain "View on
  Google Maps" link instead of widening the CSP, matching the coursedeled
  fix. The link URL is data-cms-href="map_link_url" reading from the same
  Site Settings file as the other contact facts (see js/cms-content.js's
  renderHref) -- it describes the same physical address as
  institute_name/address, so keeping it in the one place that already
  tracks "where is DIET Chennai" seemed more consistent than adding a
  second, page-only field a future address change could miss. The href
  attribute keeps a matching literal fallback value for anyone viewing the
  page before this script runs (or with it disabled).

  This page has no other editorial content beyond title/description/
  last_updated -- the "Send Us a Message"/"Find Us on Map" headings and
  form markup are structural page furniture, not per-page content, so
  they're written directly in this layout rather than exposed as CMS
  fields (nothing here is a field admin/collections/contact_us.yml lists).
#}
    <!--/.nav-wrapper-->
    <!-- Main and modifiable content starts here -->
    <!-- section divider -->
    <div class="main_content">
        <div class="wrapper" id="skipCont"></div>
        <!--/#skipCont-->
        <div id="fontSize" class="wrapper body-wrapper ">
            <div class="bg-wrapper inner-wrapper">
                <div class="breadcam-bg breadcam">
                    <div class="container common-container four_content">
                        <ul>
                            <li><a href="/" data-i18n="home">Home </a></li>
                            <li><a href="/contact-us/" data-i18n="contact-us">Contact us</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <section id="page-head" class="wrapper headings-wrapper">
                <div class="container common-container four_content">
                    <h1><i class="fa fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</i><samp data-i18n="contact-us">Contact
                            us</samp>
                    </h1>
                    <hr />
                </div>
            </section>
            <!--/#page-head-->
            <div class="container contact-us-container">
                <div class="contact-details">
                    <p><strong data-cms-text="institute_name" data-cms-source="site-settings">District Institute of Education and Training (DIET), Chennai</strong></p>
                    <p data-cms-text="address" data-cms-source="site-settings">Kamarajar Salai, Triplicane, Chennai – 600005, Tamil Nadu, India</p>
                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a data-cms-text="email" data-cms-mailto="email" data-cms-source="site-settings" href="mailto:admin@dietchennai.org,admin@dietchn.ac.in">admin@dietchennai.org, admin@dietchn.ac.in</a></p>
                    <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <span data-cms-text="phone" data-cms-source="site-settings">+91 (044) 28445582</span></p>
                </div>

                <div class="contact-form">
                    <h2>Send Us a Message</h2>
                    <form data-cms-mailto="email" data-cms-source="site-settings">
                        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                        <textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
                        <button type="submit">Send</button>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <div class="map">
                    <h2>Find Us on Map</h2>
                    <a class="map-link-btn"
                        href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=13.0476688,80.2791785"
                        data-cms-href="map_link_url" data-cms-source="site-settings"
                        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on Google Maps</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Main and modifiable content ends here -->
    <!-- section divider -->
    <!--/.body-wrapper-->
{% include "partner-carousel.njk" %}
